# What a container build never needs: installed and built output (each image
# installs and builds its own), test and render output, local data, secrets,
# and the large reference artwork and PDFs in the repo root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/out
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.data*
**/*.log
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*

.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
service-account*.json
credentials.json

*.pdf
*.png
!apps/marketing/public/**/*.png
!apps/marketing/app/**/*.png
!packages/**/*.png
